@startmindmap
* BookEditor Development Structure
** Pillar 1: Identity & Visual Soul
*** TipTap Base
*** TinyMCE-style Toolbar
*** Glassmorphism Side Annotations
*** Block Handles (Editor.js style)
*** Smart Hierarchy Navigator (sub-book, Part, Bab, Chapter, Masala)
** Pillar 2: Environment
*** Entry via Book Index "Edit"
*** Triple Mode: In-place, FullEditor, Split View
** Pillar 3: Scope & Guardrails
*** Hierarchical CRUD (Add/Move chapters/babs)
*** Sync Protection (Manual Edit Focus)
*** Version History & Conflict Alerts
*** LocalStorage Persistence
** Pillar 4: Export Options
*** Multi-format: PDF, Word, MD, JSON
*** Multi-scope: Chapter, Book, Volume
@endmindmap
